<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="hoisin-sf" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Stir Fry with Hoisin Sauce</title>

  <p>
    Ingredients
  </p>
  <tabular>
    <row>
      <cell>10 ounces super firm tofu</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>8 ounces mushrooms</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1 tablespoon rice wine or sherry</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
    <cell><m>\frac{1}{2}</m> teaspoon freshly grated lemon zest</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>kosher salt</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>\frac{1}{4}</m> teaspoon black pepper (optional)</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1 bunch broccoli, cut into 1-inch florets and blanched</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><term>Sauce:</term></cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>1 \frac{1}{2}</m> tablespoons hoisin sauce</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2  teaspoons rice wine or sherry</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 teaspoons soy sauce</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>\frac{1}{2}</m> teaspoon honey (optional)</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1 teaspoon cornstarch</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1 tablespoon canola oil</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 cloves garlic, minced</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 teaspoons minced fresh ginger</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 scallions, finely chopped</cell>
    </row>
  </tabular>

  <p>Instructions
    <ol>
      <li>
        <p>
          Press the tofu for 30 minutes.  Blot dry and cut into 1-inch squares, each <m>\frac{1}{2}</m> inch thick.  Toss with rice wine, lemon zests, and a little salt and pepper.  Let marinate for 10 minutes.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Combine hoisin sauce, rice wine, soy sauce, sugar, and cornstarch in a small bowl. Mix well.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Heat a wok almost to smoking over a high flame.  Swirl in canola oil.  Add minced garlic, ginger, and scallions.  Stir-fry these ingredients for 15 seconds, or until fragrant but not brown.  Add the tofu, mushrooms, and broccoli and stir-fry for 1 to 2 minutes, or until thoroughly heated.  Stir in the sauce and boil for 30 seconds.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Correct the seasoning, adding soy sauce if necessary, and serve at once.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </p>

  <p>
    Notes:
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
</section>